{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440310/extras/Logo.png?t=1744638741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexcavator is a charming, 3D, reimagining of Minesweeper, with hexagonal grids, upgrades, rich cosmetics, and a focus on feeling comfy.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udca3CORE GAMEPLAY\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle solving on a colourful 3D hex grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear tiles, dodge mines, and collect iron, gold, and rare crystals for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your money to unlock cool new cosmetics!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udea9PROGRESSION\ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple upgrades to make gameplay more accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements for completionists</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udca3CUSTOMIZATION\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a wide variety of visual themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique flags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your hard-earned resources on personalizing the look of the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udea9Atmosphere\ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soft, playful art style with low-poly charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soothing background sounds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udca3&quot;I just want classic Minesweeper...&quot;\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No problem! Classic Mode turns off all upgrades for pure, traditional gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440310?t=1744638741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store